  "question": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\qt0020_429dee9ebc6a.png\"/><br/>\nAn infinite wire has a circular bend of radius a, and carrying a current I as shown in figure. The magnitude of magnetic field at the origin $O$ of the arc is given by :"
